{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01VEXtqHvBFAsCd8m6pYPE7x","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Sources\n2\t\n3\tSources are immutable. Nothing under this folder is ever modified or corrected, even when a\n4\ttranscript is wrong — corrections go in the living files under `dossier/`, never here.\n5\t\n6\t- `received/` — documents received from the counterpart or the end client: brochures, briefs,\n7\t  contracts, anything sent to us.\n8\t- `transcripts/` — call recordings and their transcripts; `transcripts/raw/` holds the\n9\t  unreviewed, automatic transcript exactly as produced.\n10\t\n11\tFiles are named `YYYY-MM-DD_slug` (plus their extension). A text extraction of a PDF sits next\n12\tto the PDF, same stem, `.txt` extension.\n13\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ab324a51-d3a1-4782-91dc-f81e16f56acd","uuid":"d4237fab-69a7-465e-b5ca-4864d28e61b1","timestamp":"2026-10-10T13:01:30.874Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/var/folders/9t/1m3f81vn3bd677kc1tzbg2zm0000gn/T/tmp.1FI9Y6zQEy/sources/README.md","content":"# Sources\n\nSources are immutable. Nothing under this folder is ever modified or corrected, even when a\ntranscript is wrong — corrections go in the living files under `dossier/`, never here.\n\n- `received/` — documents received from the counterpart or the end client: brochures, briefs,\n  contracts, anything sent to us.\n- `transcripts/` — call recordings and their transcripts; `transcripts/raw/` holds the\n  unreviewed, automatic transcript exactly as produced.\n\nFiles are named `YYYY-MM-DD_slug` (plus their extension). A text extraction of a PDF sits next\nto the PDF, same stem, `.txt` extension.\n","numLines":13,"startLine":1,"totalLines":13}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01VEXtqHvBFAsCd8m6pYPE7x","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
